"""
Multi-Index Stock Data Fetcher
================================
Fetches OHLCV + technical indicators + own index + VIX + Google Trends
for every stock in the CAC40, S&P 500, and Singapore Straits Times Index.

Structure:
    ./cac40_data/      — 40 stocks  (index: CAC40)
    ./sp500_data/      — 503 stocks (index: S&P 500)
    ./sti_data/        — 30 stocks  (index: STI)

Each stock only gets its OWN index merged in, plus VIX.

Features:
    - Resume support : already-completed CSVs are skipped automatically
    - --skip-trends  : skip Google Trends (much faster, ~30min vs 10-15hrs)
    - --index        : only run one index (cac40 | sp500 | sti)

Dependencies:
    pip install yfinance pandas pytrends ta

Usage:
    python fetch_all_stocks.py                        # full run
    python fetch_all_stocks.py --skip-trends          # no Google Trends
    python fetch_all_stocks.py --index sp500          # only S&P 500
    python fetch_all_stocks.py --index sti --skip-trends
"""

